(6324919, 936342, 107730, '<td valign="top">The first time I looked at this I didn''t like it.  The second time I looked at it, I thought I saw a face... the more I look at it, I more I think I''m seeing half the face of a bird; a type of parrot perhaps.  I did have another assumption initially but I''d rather not follow that line of thought so I''ll stick with the parrot.<br/> <br/>Great job, you have me curious... decent score coming from this chook! :)</td>', 'The first time I looked at this I didn''t like it.  The second time I looked at it, I thought I saw a face... the more I look at it, I more I think I''m seeing half the face of a bird; a type of parrot perhaps.  I did have another assumption initially but I''d rather not follow that line of thought so I''ll stick with the parrot. Great job, you have me curious... decent score coming from this chook! :)', '2011-02-21 13:23:16.000000', NULL, 1),
