(6325446, 936769, 127046, '<td valign="top">Hedgehog?</td>', 'Hedgehog?', '2011-02-21 18:56:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6325447, 936804, 81362, '<td valign="top">Makes me think of a wooden yo-yo, but if quite small, could be a wooden button to cover a screw hole and make furniture look nicer, or maybe just a wooden button with a loop on the othe side to attach it to a coat. Good clean image, glad you preserved a little shadow.</td>', 'Makes me think of a wooden yo-yo, but if quite small, could be a wooden button to cover a screw hole and make furniture look nicer, or maybe just a wooden button with a loop on the othe side to attach it to a coat. Good clean image, glad you preserved a little shadow.', '2011-02-21 18:57:14.000000', NULL, 1),
