(6325456, 936818, 81362, '<td valign="top">Looks like the twisted metal shaving that sometimes results from drilling a hole in metal. Diagonal placement a good choice here, and the color is intersting.</td>', 'Looks like the twisted metal shaving that sometimes results from drilling a hole in metal. Diagonal placement a good choice here, and the color is intersting.', '2011-02-21 19:01:17.000000', NULL, 1),
