(6325487, 936329, 59891, '<td valign="top">I haven''t a clue what this is, but I like the abstractness of it, the colors, and the shapes.  Sort of like a small scale landscape in fog.</td>', 'I haven''t a clue what this is, but I like the abstractness of it, the colors, and the shapes.  Sort of like a small scale landscape in fog.', '2011-02-21 19:23:43.000000', NULL, 1),
