(6331852, 936421, 113591, '<td valign="top">Do you remember those sticky gum stuff that one blew up to be colored bubbles? You know, you squeeze it out of a tube. Then you plastered it round the end of a short hard straw. Blowing through the straw produced these nice bubbles, and you had to roll the bubble off the straw and close the hole by pinching it close. Remember? Well this isn''t it.</td>', 'Do you remember those sticky gum stuff that one blew up to be colored bubbles? You know, you squeeze it out of a tube. Then you plastered it round the end of a short hard straw. Blowing through the straw produced these nice bubbles, and you had to roll the bubble off the straw and close the hole by pinching it close. Remember? Well this isn''t it.', '2011-02-25 04:13:10.000000', NULL, 1),
