(6335124, 936894, 125659, '<td valign="top">LOL! almost dead last huh? Because the photo was too small I presume? I thought this challenge was mainly about trying to figure out what the item is in macro. 156th place out of 158.. cool! Thanks to the voters that voted based on the challenge and not the size of the photo. Gotta love those haters with the 1''s. Well, I stumped you all and that was the mission. It was the top of a Tres Generaciones Tequila bottle.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-02-28 00:42:16.</i></td>', 'LOL! almost dead last huh? Because the photo was too small I presume? I thought this challenge was mainly about trying to figure out what the item is in macro. 156th place out of 158.. cool! Thanks to the voters that voted based on the challenge and not the size of the photo. Gotta love those haters with the 1''s. Well, I stumped you all and that was the mission. It was the top of a Tres Generaciones Tequila bottle.', '2011-02-28 00:40:37.000000', '2011-02-28 00:42:16.000000', 0),
