(6337652, 936469, 104859, '<td valign="top">It''s a section of seeds from the inside of a red capsicum.  My macro setup is difficult to use due to the manual lens and extension tubes so i was lighting with led lights basically at the end of the lens which was pretty much on top of the subject matter.<br/> <br/>I am looking to build some sort of led ring light attachment and take some more shots.<br/> <br/>Thanks everyone for the votes and feedback.<br/> <br/>Keith</td>', 'It''s a section of seeds from the inside of a red capsicum.  My macro setup is difficult to use due to the manual lens and extension tubes so i was lighting with led lights basically at the end of the lens which was pretty much on top of the subject matter. I am looking to build some sort of led ring light attachment and take some more shots. Thanks everyone for the votes and feedback. Keith', '2011-03-01 18:56:12.000000', NULL, 0),
